san-diego-usw00023188-2015-2024.csv

Daily weather of GHCN-Daily station USW00023188, 2015-01-01 to 2024-12-31.

Source: NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information (NCEI), Global Historical
Climatology Network - Daily (GHCN-Daily), Version 3, station file
https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/pub/data/ghcn/daily/all/USW00023188.dly
retrieved 2026-10-10 (UTC).

