MODIFIED DATA. This file is not original NOAA data. It was reshaped from the station
file above by MineWorld's tools/weather-fetch: one row per day, the elements TMAX,
TMIN, PRCP, AWND and WDF2 in GHCN-Daily's units, fog = WT01 or WT02 or WT21, thunder =
WT03, and every missing (-9999) or quality-flagged value left empty; its gaps were
reported, not filled. It is not endorsed by NOAA, and no affiliation with NOAA is
stated or implied.

